---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Use" description="Terms of use for CalcBadger's calculators, including the accuracy disclaimer and embed license.">
	<div class="mx-auto max-w-[680px]">
		<h1 class="font-display text-3xl font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Terms of Use</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[var(--ink)]/50">Last updated: August 2, 2026</p>

		<div class="mt-6 text-[0.95rem] leading-[1.85] text-[var(--ink)]/75">
			<h2 class="font-display mt-6 mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">No professional advice</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				CalcBadger's tools are for general information and estimation. They are not financial,
				legal, medical, engineering, or construction advice. Results depend on the numbers you
				enter and the stated assumptions of each tool; verify anything consequential with a
				qualified professional or the governing authority (your bank's disclosure, your local
				building department, official score reports, and so on).
			</p>

			<h2 class="font-display mt-6 mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Accuracy</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				We test each calculator against authoritative sources and cite them on the page, but we
				cannot guarantee results are error-free or that referenced standards haven't changed since
				the page's review date. Use of the site is at your own risk; we accept no liability for
				decisions made based on calculator output.
			</p>

			<h2 class="font-display mt-6 mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Embedding our calculators</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				You may embed any CalcBadger calculator on your own site using the embed snippet provided
				on its page, free of charge, provided the "Powered by CalcBadger" attribution link remains
				visible and unmodified. We may update or discontinue embed endpoints; if that ever becomes
				necessary we'll do so in a way that fails gracefully.
			</p>

			<h2 class="font-display mt-6 mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Content</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				Site content (explanations, tables, design) is © CalcBadger. Brief quotation with a link
				is welcome; wholesale reproduction is not. Facts and formulas themselves belong to
				everyone.
			</p>

			<h2 class="font-display mt-6 mb-2 text-lg font-bold text-[var(--ink)]">Contact</h2>
			<p class="mb-4">
				Questions: <a href="mailto:contact@calcbadger.com" class="text-[var(--flag-dark)] underline underline-offset-2">contact@calcbadger.com</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Layout>
